# m3_bomb_boss: god + warp, hold A 60-440 (boss HP 60 -> 47), B at 480: the bomb does 8 to
# the boss (47 -> 39) and spends a bomb. Exact values are a regression pin for the seed.
--frames 600 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "32 debug_warp" --dump-exports debug_boss_hp,debug_bombs,debug_bullets --at "479 debug_boss_hp == 47" --at "480 debug_boss_hp == 39" --at "480 debug_bombs == 1" --at "480 debug_bullets == 0"
